---
import { EMAIL } from '../data/contact.js';
---
<div class="E-ref" id="referral-details">
  <div class="E-in">
    <h2>For referring clinicians</h2>
    <p class="lead">Everything a registrar needs before deciding where to send someone, on one screen, so nobody has to ring the rooms to find out whether I take this.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      <tr><td>Accepting from</td><td>ENT, gastroenterology, neurology, paediatrics, geriatrics, general practice. Families may also self-refer.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>How to send</td><td>Secure messaging, or scanned to {EMAIL}. Include the clinic letter and any imaging or endoscopy report.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Turnaround</td><td>Patient contacted within two working days. Assessed within ten. Written correspondence back to you within five days of assessment.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Where</td><td>Rooms in Umina Beach; home and residential care visits from Gosford to Killcare; telehealth for review and carer training.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Funding</td><td>NDIS, Home Care Packages, DVA, Medicare CDM, private health. Fee schedule on request.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div class="limits">
      <b>What I don't do</b>
      <p>No instrumental assessment. If a patient needs videofluoroscopy or FEES to answer the question, I will say so in the first letter and send them back to you rather than working around it for six weeks. Same for anything needing a laryngeal view before voice therapy, and for tracheostomy or ventilated patients.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
